    "b65bd678-e60d-4643-a2b8-e19727f278d8": {
      "id": "b65bd678-e60d-4643-a2b8-e19727f278d8",
      "message": {
        "author": {
          "name": null,
          "role": "assistant"
        },
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "To build your **full sales script** in the Limitless format, I need the details that the script is built around. The methodology requires the script to be customized to your offer and prospect rather than generic. The knowledge base also states the script should be personalized into language you would naturally use. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file6\ue202L1-L40\ue201\n\nPlease answer the following:\n\n1. **What do you sell?** (Program/service)\n2. **Who is your ideal client?**\n3. **What is your core promise or transformation?**\n4. **Price of your offer?**\n5. **Program length?**\n6. **How is it delivered?** (1:1, group, course, hybrid)\n7. **Your biggest proof/results?** (Your results + client results)\n8. **Your unique process/framework** (if you have one)\n9. **Common objections you hear**\n10. **Do you have a guarantee?** (If yes, what?)\n\nOnce I have that, I'll produce the complete script in the exact Limitless structure:\n\n- **RAPPORT**\n- **FRAME**\n- **PAIN**\n- **DISCOVERY** (covering all 11 required discovery topics)\n- **PRE-PITCH**\n- **PILLAR 1**\n- **PILLAR 2**\n- **PILLAR 3**\n- **PILLAR 4** (if applicable)\n- **TEMPERATURE CHECK**\n- **DELIVERY**\n- **PRICE DROP**\n- **CLOSE**\n- **OBJECTION HANDLING**\n- **NEXT STEPS**\n\nIt will be written word-for-word, ready to memorize and use on live calls, following the Limitless sales framework and sequence. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file6\ue202L41-L120\ue201 \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201"
          ]
        },
